hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3040","###\n Muhammad bin Abd al-A'la al-San'ani narrated to us, saying: Khalid bin al-Harith narrated to us, saying: Shu'bah narrated, saying: I heard An-Nu'man bin Salam say: I heard Amr bin Aws narrating from Ibn Razin, who said: \O Messenger of Allah (ﷺ)"","" my father is an elderly man who is unable to perform Hajj or Umrah"","" nor can he travel.\"" The Prophet (ﷺ) said: \""Perform Hajj on behalf"""""
